.SS "template<uint32_t dim> std::map< std::string, \fBOperand\fP< dim > >::iterator \fBcsmp::Interrelation\fP< dim >::Result ()\fR [inline]\fP"
Returns an iterator to the result \fBOperand\fP / property of a calculation\&.

.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
An iterator to an STL map where the name of each physical variable is used as a key to store the Operands\&.
